      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Learn how to set up and use Ogre3d to provide a powerful and extensible 3d graphical engine. The focus is on explaining the core concepts and objects needed to get rendering up and running, as well as how to integrate the graphical engine with a game.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
